# Normalize line endings: LF in the repository AND in every working tree.
# Prettier enforces LF (default endOfLine), so checkouts must not rewrite
# text files to CRLF regardless of platform or core.autocrlf settings.
# Without this, `npm run format:check` fails on a fresh Windows checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.wasm binary
